# Customer Segmentation using K-Means Clustering

## Objective

Group customers of a retail store based on their purchase behaviour.

## Dataset

Mall Customers Dataset

## Features Used

- Annual Income (k$)
- Spending Score (1-100)

## Algorithm

K-Means Clustering

## Steps

1. Data Preprocessing
2. Elbow Method
3. K-Means Clustering
4. Cluster Visualisation

## Outcome

Identified customer segments that can help businesses target marketing campaigns effectively.
